ue, expenditure, borrowing and fiscal policy.\",\"hi\":\"लोक वित्त सरकारी राजस्व, व्यय, उधारी और राजकोषीय नीति का अध्ययन करता है।\"}},\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified: SSC CGL Finance and Economics — Methods of Economic Study\",\"source_metadata\":null,\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"SSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0}],\"nextCursor\":\"a338c214-fbc5-4d08-9d90-c417db7dff24\",\"hasMore\":true}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":300,"tags":["question-batch","question-batch:subtopic:v9:9641488b-10c6-4c41-a0ca-026f6d8f17fb"]}